<h1>Support Desk reference host</h1>
<p class="notice">Synthetic accounts and tickets. Local demo only. No model provider is called.</p>
<p>Sign in to stream a ticket, save a private draft, continue the conversation, and close the ticket.</p>
<h2>Try the workflow</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Choose Alice, enter a private note, and wait for “Draft saved”. Reload to check the saved note.</li>
  <li>Continue the conversation, then close the ticket. Reload to review its persisted status.</li>
  <li>Try Reader for read-only access, or Bob for a separate tenant.</li>
</ol>
<p>Alice and Reader belong to the north tenant. Bob belongs to the south tenant. These are local synthetic accounts.</p>
<% %w[Alice Bob Reader].each do |name| %>
  <%= button_to "Sign in as #{name}", session_path, params: { name: name } %>
<% end %>
